{"id": "1b4c498c-d97f-47a2-8c77-5c5ff85bc15d", "slug": "motion-design-sequence-1", "title": "Motion Design Sequence", "description": "Motion Design Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Motion Design Sequence\"\ndescription: \"Motion Design Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#050505\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#050505\"\n  background: \"#050505\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Motion Design Sequence\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Meng To (@mengto). Views: 270; favorites: 22; remixes: 7.\nTags: dashboard, animated, webgl, dither, charts, flow, effect.\n## Overview\nMotion Design Dashboard Section is designed for demonstrating application workflows and interface hierarchy. Key features include clear information density, modular panels, and interface rhythm. It is suitable for product showcases, admin panels, and analytics experiences.\n\nStandalone motion design opener sequence. Transitions through phrases: Observe. A New Standard For Performance. Momentum is Absolute. Synthesis Complete. Observe. A New Standard For Performance. sys.architecture v.2.0.4…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Observe.; A; New; Standard; For; Performance..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #050505, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #050505, background #050505, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nDashboard, chart, and data panels should preserve their compact operational hierarchy, nested surfaces, and metric emphasis.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Motion Design Sequence</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n    <link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.gstatic.com\" crossorigin>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#050505] text-[#FAFAFA] overflow-hidden w-screen h-screen relative antialiased selection:bg-white selection:text-black\" style=\"font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; scrollbar-width: none;\">\n\n    <!-- Accessibility Screen Reader Announcer -->\n    <div class=\"sr-only\" aria-live=\"polite\">\n        Standalone motion design opener sequence. Transitions through phrases: Observe. A New Standard For Performance. Momentum is Absolute. Synthesis Complete.\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- WebGL-style Canvas Layer -->\n    <canvas id=\"bg-canvas\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none z-0\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Sequence 1: Intro (Observe) -->\n    <div id=\"seq-1\" class=\"seq absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center flex-col z-10 bg-[#050505]\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <h1 class=\"text-7xl md:text-9xl font-medium tracking-tighter uppercase text-white origin-center text-center\">\n            Observe.\n        </h1>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Sequence 2: Aggressive Build (Word Flash) -->\n    <div id=\"seq-2\" class=\"seq absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-20 pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <h2 class=\"word-flash absolute text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-light tracking-tighter uppercase text-white opacity-0 scale-50\">A</h2>\n        <h2 class=\"word-flash absolute text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-light tracking-tighter uppercase text-white opacity-0 scale-50\">New</h2>\n        <h2 class=\"word-flash absolute text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-light tracking-tighter uppercase text-white opacity-0 scale-50\">Standard</h2>\n        <h2 class=\"word-flash absolute text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-light tracking-tighter uppercase text-white opacity-0 scale-50\">For</h2>\n        <h2 class=\"word-flash absolute text-6xl md:text-8xl lg:text-9xl font-medium tracking-tighter uppercase text-white opacity-0 scale-50\">Performance.</h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Sequence 3: Complexity & Density -->\n    <div id=\"seq-3\" class=\"seq absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center z-30 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div id=\"seq-3-box\" class=\"border border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-900/30 backdrop-blur-sm p-8 md:p-12 relative w-[90%] max-w-5xl aspect-[4/3] md:aspect-[21/9] flex flex-col justify-between overflow-hidden\" style=\"box-shadow: inset 0 0 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\">\n\n            <!-- Tech UI Corners -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-l border-neutral-400\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-t border-r border-neutral-400\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 left-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-l border-neutral-400\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-neutral-400\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Background Structural Lines -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none opacity-20\">\n                <div class=\"absolute left-1/3 top-0 bottom-0 border-l border-dashed border-neutral-500\"></div>\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-0 right-0 border-t border-dashed border-neutral-500\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex justify-between items-start w-full relative z-10 text-xs text-neutral-500 tracking-widest uppercase font-light\">\n                <span class=\"seq-3-el origin-left\">sys.architecture</span>\n                <span class=\"seq-3-el origin-right\">v.2.0.4</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"mt-auto relative z-10 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end w-full\">\n                <div class=\"overflow-hidden pb-2\">\n                    <h2 class=\"seq-3-text text-5xl md:text-7xl font-medium tracking-tighter text-white leading-[0.95]\">\n                        MOMENTUM IS<br>ABSOLUTE.\n                    </h2>\n                    <p class=\"seq-3-text mt-6 text-xs md:text-sm text-neutral-400 max-w-sm leading-relaxed font-light\">\n                        SYSTEMS RECALIBRATED. METRICS SYNCED. 5 NODES DEPLOYED. MASTER FRAMEWORK ONLINE. WE ENGINEER THE FLOW.\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"seq-3-text hidden md:flex flex-col items-end text-xs text-neutral-500 tracking-widest uppercase font-light gap-1\">\n                    <span>1920 × 1080</span>\n                    <span>60.00 FPS</span>\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-[1px] bg-neutral-600 mt-2\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Sequence 4: Resolve -->\n    <div id=\"seq-4\" class=\"seq absolute inset-0 flex items-center justify-center flex-col z-40\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n        <div id=\"seq-4-content\" class=\"flex flex-col items-center\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-neutral-900/60 backdrop-blur-xl px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full border border-neutral-800 shadow-2xl\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-lg md:text-xl text-neutral-300\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                <span class=\"text-xs md:text-sm font-medium tracking-widest text-neutral-300 uppercase\">Synthesis Complete</span>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Progress Bar -->\n            <div class=\"w-48 md:w-64 h-[1px] bg-neutral-800 mt-6 relative overflow-hidden\">\n                <div id=\"progress-bar-fill\" class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-white origin-left scale-x-0\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- 1. Custom 3D Particle Network (WebGL-style Canvas) ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('bg-canvas');\n        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');\n        let width, height;\n        const points = [];\n        const numPoints = 120; // Optimized for plexus performance\n        let fov = 400;\n\n        // Dynamic animation parameters controlled by GSAP\n        let canvasParams = {\n            speed: 0.001,\n            connectRadius: 12000,\n            lineAlphaMulti: 0.15\n        };\n\n        function initCanvas() {\n            width = canvas.width = window.innerWidth;\n            height = canvas.height = window.innerHeight;\n\n            points.length = 0;\n            for(let i = 0; i < numPoints; i++) {\n                points.push({\n                    x: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2000,\n                    y: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2000,\n                    z: Math.random() * 2000,\n                    baseSize: Math.random() * 1.5 + 0.5\n                });\n            }\n        }\n\n        function draw() {\n            ctx.clearRect(0, 0, width, height);\n\n            const cx = width / 2;\n            const cy = height / 2;\n\n            // Project 3D to 2D\n            points.forEach(p => {\n                p.z -= canvasParams.speed * 1000;\n                if (p.z < 1) {\n                    p.z = 2000;\n                    p.x = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2000;\n                    p.y = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 2000;\n                }\n\n                p.px = (p.x * fov) / p.z + cx;\n                p.py = (p.y * fov) / p.z + cy;\n                p.size = (p.baseSize * fov) / p.z;\n                p.alpha = Math.max(0, 1 - (p.z / 2000));\n            });\n\n            // Draw Plexus Lines\n            ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;\n            for(let i = 0; i < points.length; i++) {\n                for(let j = i + 1; j < points.length; j++) {\n                    let dx = points[i].px - points[j].px;\n                    let dy = points[i].py - points[j].py;\n                    let distSq = dx * dx + dy * dy;\n\n                    if (distSq < canvasParams.connectRadius) {\n                        let lineAlpha = (1 - distSq / canvasParams.connectRadius) * Math.min(points[i].alpha, points[j].alpha);\n                        ctx.strokeStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${lineAlpha * canvasParams.lineAlphaMulti})`;\n                        ctx.beginPath();\n                        ctx.moveTo(points[i].px, points[i].py);\n                        ctx.lineTo(points[j].px, points[j].py);\n                        ctx.stroke();\n                    }\n                }\n            }\n\n            // Draw Dots\n            points.forEach(p => {\n                if (p.px > 0 && p.px < width && p.py > 0 && p.py < height) {\n                    ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(255, 255, 255, ${p.alpha * 0.7})`;\n                    ctx.beginPath();\n                    ctx.arc(p.px, p.py, p.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);\n                    ctx.fill();\n                }\n            });\n\n            requestAnimationFrame(draw);\n        }\n\n        window.addEventListener('resize', initCanvas);\n        initCanvas();\n        draw();\n\n        // --- 2. GSAP Cinematic Choreography Timeline ---\n        const tl = gsap.timeline();\n        const prefersReducedMotion = window.matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)').matches;\n\n        if (prefersReducedMotion) {\n            // Fallback for accessibility\n            gsap.set(['#seq-1', '#seq-2', '#seq-3'], { display: 'none' });\n            gsap.set('#seq-4', { opacity: 1 });\n            gsap.set('#progress-bar-fill', { scaleX: 1 });\n        } else {\n            // Setup\n            gsap.set('.seq', { autoAlpha: 0, display: 'none' });\n            gsap.set('.seq-3-text', { y: 50, opacity: 0 });\n            gsap.set('.seq-3-el', { scale: 0.8, opacity: 0 });\n\n            // Seq 1: Intro (Blur & Scale Focus)\n            tl.set('#seq-1', { display: 'flex', autoAlpha: 1 })\n              .fromTo('#seq-1 h1',\n                { filter: 'blur(40px)', scale: 1.5, opacity: 0 },\n                { filter: 'blur(0px)', scale: 1, opacity: 1, duration: 2.5, ease: 'power3.inOut' }\n              )\n              .to('#seq-1 h1', { filter: 'blur(30px)', scale: 0.7, opacity: 0, duration: 1.2, ease: 'power2.in' })\n              .set('#seq-1', { display: 'none' });\n\n            // Seq 2: Build (Aggressive Flash Typography)\n            tl.set('#seq-2', { display: 'flex', autoAlpha: 1 })\n              .to(canvasParams, { speed: 0.005, duration: 1, ease: 'power2.in' }, \"<\"); // Canvas speeds up slightly\n\n            const words = document.querySelectorAll('.word-flash');\n            words.forEach((word, index) => {\n                tl.fromTo(word,\n                    { opacity: 0, scale: 1.3, filter: 'blur(10px)' },\n                    { opacity: 1, scale: 1, filter: 'blur(0px)', duration: 0.15, ease: 'power1.out' }\n                ).to(word,\n                    { opacity: 0, scale: 0.85, filter: 'blur(8px)', duration: 0.15, ease: 'power1.in' },\n                    \"+=0.08\"\n                );\n            });\n            tl.set('#seq-2', { display: 'none' });\n\n            // Seq 3: Complexity (High Density UI, Warp Speed)\n            tl.set('#seq-3', { display: 'flex', autoAlpha: 1 })\n              .to(canvasParams, { speed: 0.025, connectRadius: 35000, lineAlphaMulti: 0.3, duration: 2, ease: 'power3.inOut' }, \"<\") // Warp speed\n              .fromTo('#seq-3-box',\n                { scale: 0.85, opacity: 0, rotationX: 15, transformPerspective: 1000 },\n                { scale: 1, opacity: 1, rotationX: 0, duration: 1.8, ease: 'expo.out' }\n              )\n              .to('.seq-3-el', { scale: 1, opacity: 1, duration: 1, stagger: 0.1, ease: 'power2.out' }, \"-=1.4\")\n              .to('.seq-3-text', { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1.2, stagger: 0.1, ease: 'power4.out' }, \"-=1.2\")\n\n              // Hold phase\n              .to({}, { duration: 1.5 })\n\n              // Extreme scale out past camera\n              .to('#seq-3-box', { scale: 5, opacity: 0, filter: 'blur(30px)', duration: 1.2, ease: 'power4.in' })\n              .set('#seq-3', { display: 'none' });\n\n            // Seq 4: Resolve (Minimal Lockup)\n            tl.set('#seq-4', { display: 'flex', autoAlpha: 1 })\n              .to(canvasParams, { speed: 0.0003, connectRadius: 10000, lineAlphaMulti: 0.1, duration: 2.5, ease: 'power4.out' }, \"<\") // Ultra slow\n              .fromTo('#seq-4-content',\n                { scale: 0.9, opacity: 0, filter: 'blur(15px)', y: 20 },\n                { scale: 1, opacity: 1, filter: 'blur(0px)', y: 0, duration: 2, ease: 'expo.out' }\n              )\n              .to('#progress-bar-fill',\n                { scaleX: 1, duration: 2, ease: 'power2.inOut' },\n                \"-=1.2\"\n              );\n        }\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "motion-design-sequence-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/motion-design-sequence-1.jpg", "source_name": "motion-design-sequence-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 454, "forks": 16, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "9109ecbb-cdc4-4815-981e-2ea83be13765", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-01T13:24:54.569367+00:00"}